HTTP Server from Scratch in C
=============================
Teodoro (2026)

This repository documents my journey of learning how HTTP works
and implementing its core concepts in the C programming language.

References:
- The C Programming Language. 2nd Edition Book by Brian Kernighan and Dennis Ritchie
- https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc1945/
- https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP
- https://beej.us/guide/bgnet/html/index-wide.html
